sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Customer
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant F as Orders Cloud Run service
    participant D as Firestore
    U->>A: POST /orders
    A->>F: invoke
    F->>D: write order
    D-->>F: ok
    alt payment approved
      F-)A: OrderConfirmed event
    else declined
      F-->>A: 402
    end
    F->>F: validate
    A-->>U: 201 Created
